{
  "slug": "meticulous",
  "name": "Meticulous",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent skills for Meticulous visual regression testing — review test runs, investigate replays, debug diffs. Also connects the hosted Meticulous MCP server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `meticulous-cli` (Overview of the Meticulous CLI tool and its global options), `meticulous-cli-update` (Check whether the Meticulous CLI (@alwaysmeticulous/cli) is installed and up to date, and install/update it if not), `meticulous-iterative-dev` (Iterative frontend development loop using Meticulous for per-step visual validation), `meticulous-review` (Analyze a completed Meticulous test run — fetch the diff summary, inspect representative screenshots, DOM diffs, and timelines), `meticulous-simulate-and-diff` (Run a Meticulous session simulation against a live URL and analyze the visual output — either by inspecting…), `meticulous-test` (Run a Meticulous test run after implementing a frontend change, then hand off to the `meticulous-review` skill to…), `meticulous-use-session-data` (Download and use structured Meticulous session data (user flows + network mocks) for testing code changes locally)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `meticulous`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install meticulous@claude-community` from `alwaysmeticulous/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
